[21.171792, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mWrite plus_comm.v\r\nWrote file successfully: plus_comm.v\r\n"]
[22.105652, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[22.479095, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /workspace && coqc plus_comm.v && ls -la plus_comm.vo && echo \"COMPILED OK\"\r\nFile \"./plus_comm.v\", line 10, characters 10-21:\r\nError: In environment\r\nm : nat\r\nUnable to unify \"?M1094 + 0 = ?M1094\" with \"m = m + 0\".\r\n"]
[23.19988, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[23.684571, "o", "`Nat.add_0_r` has the opposite orientation. Fixing the base case:\r\n"]
[23.695814, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit plus_comm.v\r\nIndex: plus_comm.v\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- plus_comm.v\r\n+++ plus_comm.v\r\n@@ -6,9 +6,9 @@\r\n   intros n m.\r\n   induction n as [|n' IHn'].\r\n   - simpl.\r\n     (* Base case: 0 + m = m + 0, i.e. m = m + 0 *)\r\n-    apply Nat.add_0_r.\r\n+    symmetry. apply Nat.add_0_r.\r\n   - simpl.\r\n     (* Inductive case: S (n' + m) = m + S n' *)\r\n     rewrite plus_n_Sm.\r\n     rewrite IHn'.\r\n\r\n"]
[24.447142, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[24.790203, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /workspace && coqc plus_comm.v && ls -la plus_comm.vo && echo \"COMPILED OK\"\r\nFile \"./plus_comm.v\", line 14, characters 4-16:\r\nError: Found no subterm matching \"n' + m\" in the current goal.\r\n"]
[25.674198, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[28.008108, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /workspace && cat > /tmp/opencode/inspect.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\nGoal forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n.\r\nProof.\r\n  intros n m.\r\n  induction n as [|n' IHn'].\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    symmetry. apply Nat.add_0_r.\r\n  - simpl.\r\n    rewrite plus_n_Sm.\r\n    Show.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqtop < /tmp/opencode/inspect.v 2>&1 | tail -20\r\nn', m : nat\r\n  IHn' : n' + m = m + n'\r\n  ============================\r\n  S (n' + m) = m + S n'\r\n\r\nUnnamed_thm < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  n', m : nat\r\n  IHn' : n' + m = m + n'\r\n  ============================\r\n  n' + S m = m + S n'\r\n\r\nUnnamed_thm < 1 goal\r\n  \r\n  n', m : nat\r\n  IHn' : n' + m = m + n'\r\n  ============================\r\n  n' + S m = m + S n'\r\n\r\nUnnamed_thm <\r\n"]
[29.739551, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[32.341462, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /workspace && cat > /tmp/opencode/check.v <<'EOF'\r\nRequire Import Arith.\r\nCheck plus_n_Sm.\r\nCheck Nat.add_0_r.\r\nCheck plus_n_O.\r\nPrint plus_n_Sm.\r\nEOF\r\ncoqtop < /tmp/opencode/check.v 2>&1 | tail -20\r\nCoq < Nat.add_0_r\r\n     : forall n : nat, n + 0 = n\r\n\r\nCoq < plus_n_O\r\n     : forall n : nat, n = n + 0\r\n\r\nCoq < Fetching opaque proofs from disk for Coq.Init.Peano\r\nplus_n_Sm =\r\nfun n m : nat =>\r\nnat_ind (fun n0 : nat => S (n0 + m) = n0 + S m)\r\n  (eq_refl : S (0 + m) = 0 + S m)\r\n  (fun (n0 : nat) (IHn : S (n0 + m) = n0 + S m) =>\r\n   f_equal_nat nat S (S (n0 + m)) (n0 + S m) IHn : S (S n0 + m) = S n0 + S m)\r\n  n\r\n     : forall n m : nat, S (n + m) = n + S m\r\n\r\nArguments plus_n_Sm (n m)%nat_scope\r\n\r\nCoq <\r\n"]
[33.444875, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[36.271559, "o", "`plus_n_Sm` in Coq 8.18 is oriented `S (n + m) = n + S m`, so I need to rewrite it right-to-left on the RHS.\r\n"]
[36.283074, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit plus_comm.v\r\nIndex: plus_comm.v\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- plus_comm.v\r\n+++ plus_comm.v\r\n@@ -9,8 +9,8 @@\r\n     (* Base case: 0 + m = m + 0, i.e. m = m + 0 *)\r\n     symmetry. apply Nat.add_0_r.\r\n   - simpl.\r\n     (* Inductive case: S (n' + m) = m + S n' *)\r\n-    rewrite plus_n_Sm.\r\n+    rewrite <- plus_n_Sm.\r\n     rewrite IHn'.\r\n     reflexivity.\r\n Qed.\r\n\r\n"]
[37.282521, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[37.626566, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /workspace && coqc plus_comm.v && ls -la plus_comm.vo && echo \"COMPILED OK\"\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 14523 Nov  1 07:48 plus_comm.vo\r\nCOMPILED OK\r\n"]
[38.979372, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[39.358852, "o", "\u001b[0m→ \u001b[0mRead plus_comm.v \r\n"]
[40.042305, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[41.315132, "o", "Done. The proof is complete and compiles cleanly.\r\n\r\n## What was missing\r\n\r\nThe file had two `admit`s, one in each case of the induction on `n`.\r\n\r\n**Base case (`n = 0`):**\r\n- Goal after `simpl`: `m = m + 0`\r\n- Fix: `symmetry. apply Nat.add_0_r.` (the lemma is oriented as `n + 0 = n`)\r\n\r\n**Inductive case (`n = S n'`):**\r\n- Goal after `simpl`: `S (n' + m) = m + S n'`\r\n- Fix: `rewrite <- plus_n_Sm.` to turn the RHS `m + S n'` into `S (m + n')`, then `rewrite IHn'` to replace `n' + m` with `m + n'`, and `reflexivity`.\r\n\r\nNote: In Coq 8.18, `plus_n_Sm` is oriented `S (n + m) = n + S m`, so it must be used right-to-left (`rewrite <-`) here.\r\n\r\n## Result\r\n\r\n- `/workspace/plus_comm.v` — completed proof (no `admit`/`Admitted`)\r\n- `/workspace/plus_comm.vo` — successfully produced by `coqc plus_comm.v` (14,523 bytes)\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ cd /workspace && coqc plus_comm.v\r\nCOMPILED OK\r\n```\r\n"]
